	<string>Multiflix uses the camera so you can record videos and take photos to share in the app — for example, recording a short video for your feed, capturing a story, or taking a new profile picture.</string>
	<key>NSMicrophoneUsageDescription</key>
	<string>Multiflix uses the microphone to record sound together with your videos — for example, capturing your voice or the background audio while you record a clip for your feed or a story.</string>
	<key>NSPhotoLibraryUsageDescription</key>
	<string>Multiflix accesses your photo library so you can pick existing photos and videos to share — for example, selecting a video from your gallery to post to your feed or choosing a photo to set as your profile picture.</string>
	<key>NSPhotoLibraryAddUsageDescription</key>
